what I gave them.... www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\",\"uploadDate\":\"2013-11-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Domestos Wacky Character Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>This is my character voiceover for a Domestos TV advert. I was asked to come up with the voices and this is what I gave them.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Multiple characters</h2>\r\n<p>Character voice work is a large part of what I do on a daily basis. I've done too many characters to possibly take stock of them all, and I've just added a bunch more for Domestos! It's always fun with a brand gives you creative reign and this is exactly what Doemstos did. Did you'd like to hear some more characters, check out my <a href=\"/character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voiceover\">character showreel</a>. I was also asked to provide most of the worms' voices for <a href=\"/worms-wmd-character-voices\" title=\"Worms WMD Character Voices\">Worms WMD</a> and I've provided the voice of Santa for the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yi-4Fm40nmE\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"GoJetter's Chrsitmas Special Santa Voiceover\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GoJetter's Christmas special</a>.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4z5YmovEb9E","title":"Domestos Wacky Character Voiceover","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/character-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Character Voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2>Character creation</h2>\r\n<p>People use <a href=\"https://www.domestos.com/uk/home.html\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Domestos\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Domestos</a> and this ad was broadcast across the UAE. It is very similar to the UK version.<br>\r\nI'm thinking one of the creatures sounds a little like <a href=\"/michael-caine-voiceover\" title=\"Michael Caine Voiceover\">Michael Caine </a>for some reason...<br>Always fun when there are multiple voices to come up with. I was really pleased how it turned out.<br>\r\nWhat can I come up with for you? Let's create something completely unique (or with one Michael Caine voice in there too).</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>Are you looking for a character voice for your next <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a>? Please get in touch if you'd like to work with me! I'm more than happy to send a short sample of your script. Please send a few lines of the script first so you can be sure I'm right for your brand. I make the whole process as easy as possible with 99% of the jobs delivered the same day!</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Domestos Wacky Character Voiceover","pageUrl":"voiceover-character"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","590",{"href":